    {"name": "热插拔通知", "description": "注册回调以实时获知 USB 设备的连接与断开事件，基于各平台机制（udev/netlink/IOKit 通知/Windows 消息）实现", "evidence": ["libusb/hotplug.c", "libusb/os/linux_udev.c", "libusb/os/darwin_usb.c:hotplug_poll", "libusb/os/windows_hotplug.c"]},
